    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohoe Spring are delighted to bring to the market this Spacious 3 Bedroom Duplex Apartment with Large Terrace Excellent Location Close to Cavan Town Centre. BEING SOLD WITH SITTING TENANT - Ideal Investment Opportunity. For Sale by Private Treaty. \n\n \n\nThis well presented duplex apartment offers spacious living accommodation extending to C. 89 sqm / 957 sq. ft. comprising;\n\nEntrance hall (1.1 x 1.8)\n\nUpper landing (1.8 x 1.0)\n\nLiving room/Kitchen (6.3 x 4.4) with vaulted ceiling and open to Dining area (2.2 x 2.0) and door to Terrace (8.4 x 2.9) with storage shed (0.9 x 2.9)\n\nBedroom 1 (2.8 x 4.6) with double B.I.W. En-suite (2.9 x 1.7)\n\nLower Landing (3.4 x 1.0)\n\nShower room (2.3 x 1.4)\n\nBedroom 2 (3.3 x 3.1) with double B.I.W.\n\nBedroom 3 (2.8 x 3.3) with BIW\n\nHot Press (0.9 x 1.3) with under-stair storage space.\n\n \n\nThe apartment is presented to market in good condition throughout and is being sold with sitting tenant. Current rental income is 1500 per month / 18,000 per annum.\n\n \n\nBuilt C. 2002 of standard block construction with plaster finish, slate roof, concrete floor and timber effect double glazed windows doors. Connected to all mains services, electric storage heating (day/night meter) located in fibre broadband area. BER Rating: E1.\n\nOne designated parking space is located in the rear car park.\n\n \n\nManagement company in place with annual management fee of 1,350. \n\n \n\nAn excellent opportunity for those looking for a rental investment or seeking to expand their property portfolio.\n\n \n\nEnjoying an excellent close to Cavan Town Centre and walking distance of a wide range of amenities in Cavan Town which include; shops, restaurants, hotels, schools, college, hospital, sport facilities bus station. C. 1.5 hr drive to Dublin Belfast. GPS: 53.992987, -7.357537. \n\n \n\nHighly Recommended. \n\n \n\nPROPERTY SOLD WITH SITTING TENANT - NOTICE REQUIRED TO VIEW STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY. \n\n"
      },
      {
